                            <li>Develop and maintain backend and optimization systems for a Vehicle Routing platform, contributing to production logistics and fleet optimization workflows.</li>
                            <li>Designed routing and data-processing pipelines in Python using OSRM and MongoDB, with automated Excel&harr;JSON transformations for operational planning and reporting.</li>
                            <li>Built and operate CI/CD pipelines on self-hosted GitLab and Jenkins with SonarQube integration, automating builds, tests and deployments that were previously manual.</li>
